{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"SUSE-SU-2026:5088-1","published":"2026-11-03T14:34:04Z","modified":"2026-11-04T14:15:13.332944747Z","related":["CVE-2026-74469","CVE-2026-89544","CVE-2026-89551","CVE-2026-89674","CVE-2026-98432"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-74469","CVE-2026-89544","CVE-2026-89551","CVE-2026-89674","CVE-2026-98432"],"summary":"Security update for the Linux Kernel (Live Patch 87 for SUSE Linux Enterprise 12 SP5)","details":"\nThis update for the SUSE Linux Enterprise Kernel 4.12.14-122.328 fixes various security issues:\n\nThe following security issues were fixed:\n\n- CVE-2026-74469: sctp: prevent peer transport count overflow (bsc#1280693).\n- CVE-2026-89544: SUNRPC: fix gssx_dec_option_array error path bugs (bsc#1280760).\n- CVE-2026-89551: SUNRPC: xdr_buf_trim: clamp buf->len to avoid underflow (bsc#1280728).\n- CVE-2026-89674: nfsd: fix XDR length calculation in nfsd4_ff_encode_layoutget (bsc#1280285).\n- CVE-2026-98432: ipv4: free inet_opt and ireq_opt after an RCU grace period (bsc#1285686).\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"kgraft-patch-SLE12-SP5_Update_87","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise Live Patching 12 SP5","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/kgraft-patch-SLE12-SP5_Update_87&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20Live%20Patching%2012%20SP5"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2-2.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"kgraft-patch-4_12_14-122_328-default":"2-2.1"}]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/osv/SUSE-SU-2026:5088-1.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://www.suse.com/support/update/announcement/2026/suse-su-20265088-1/"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1280285"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1280693"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1280728"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1280760"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1285686"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.suse.com/secu